      "title_at_revision": "Brakes",
      "text": "For rotorcraft with wheel-type landing gear, a braking device must be installed that is:\n(a) Controllable by the pilot;\n(b) Usable during power-off landings; and\n(c) Adequate to:\n  (1) Counteract any norm al unbalanced torque when starting or stopping the rotor; and\n  (2) Hold the rotorcraft parked on a 10\u00b0 slope on a dry, smooth pavement.",
